<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>New shop order</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #0f172a; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; background: #1e293b; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #334155; }
    .header { background: #0f172a; padding: 28px 40px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #334155; }
    .brand { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #38bdf8; }
    .brand strong { color: #cbd5e1; }
    .body { padding: 36px 40px; color: #cbd5e1; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #f1f5f9; }
    p { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #94a3b8; }
    .client-badge { display: inline-block; background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 16px; margin: 4px 0 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 600; }
    .client-badge span { color: #38bdf8; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .order-card { background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .order-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 12px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b; font-size: 14px; }
    .order-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .order-row .lbl { color: #64748b; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
    .order-row .val { color: #e2e8f0; font-weight: 500; text-align: right; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; background: #052e16; border: 1px solid #166534; color: #22c55e; border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #0ea5e9; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 13px 28px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin: 8px 0 24px; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 40px; font-size: 11px; color: #475569; border-top: 1px solid #334155; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="brand">Studio<strong>Flow</strong></div>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h1>New shop order 🛍️</h1>
      <p>Hi <%= @owner.name.presence || @owner.email %>, a client just placed an order through your studio shop.</p>

      <div class="client-badge">
        <span>Client</span>
        <%= @client.name.presence || @client.email %>
      </div>

      <div class="order-card">
        <div class="order-row">
          <span class="lbl">Item</span>
          <span class="val"><%= @item.title %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="order-row">
          <span class="lbl">Type</span>
          <span class="val"><%= @item.item_type.capitalize %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="order-row">
          <span class="lbl">Quantity</span>
          <span class="val"><%= @order.quantity %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="order-row">
          <span class="lbl">Total</span>
          <span class="val"><%= sprintf("%.2f", @order.total_cents / 100.0) %> <%= @order.currency.upcase %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="order-row">
          <span class="lbl">Status</span>
          <span class="val"><span class="badge"><%= @order.status.capitalize %></span></span>
        </div>
        <% if @order.rental_due_date %>
        <div class="order-row">
          <span class="lbl">Return by</span>
          <span class="val"><%= @order.rental_due_date.strftime('%B %-d, %Y') %></span>
        </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>

      <a href="<%= @orders_url %>" class="btn">View all orders →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      You received this email because you are a studio owner on StudioFlow.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
